      "title": "Amazon Inks $1B SNPS Deal to Power AWS Custom Chips: Should You Hold?",
      "summary": "Amazon signed a $1B+ multi-year IP agreement with Synopsys to accelerate custom chip design for AWS. AWS revenues grew 37% to $42.2B in Q2 with a $496B backlog, while Amazon's chips business surpassed $25B annual revenue run rate. However, Amazon raised 2026 capex to $220B, resulting in negative free cash flow and capacity constraints. The stock trades at a premium valuation with intensifying competition from Microsoft, Google, and Oracle in cloud infrastructure.",
